1. Dispatch logic

In [attention_layer.cpp:119](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-inference/runtime/src/backend/attention_layer.cpp#L119) I added local env helpers for `NEMOTRON_FORWARD_ATTENTION_PRODUCTION` (default enabled) and `NEMOTRON_FORWARD_ATTENTION_SCALAR_FALLBACK`. In the non-cuDNN branch at [attention_layer.cpp:875](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-inference/runtime/src/backend/attention_layer.cpp#L875), the dispatcher now does this:
- `token_count == 1` and production enabled and scalar fallback not forced: `RunPagedAttentionDecodeProduction(...)`
- otherwise: existing `RunPagedAttentionDeviceFallback(...)`

The cuDNN path is unchanged, and the existing `NEMOTRON_FORWARD_COMPARE_DEVICE_ATTENTION` compare hook remains where it was. `attention_device_fallback.h` was already included, so no include change was needed.

